{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-cdn-snippet",
  "category": "feedback",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-cdn-snippet&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-cdn-snippet",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "Panel copy-paste via <code>loader.min.js</code>: un script del loader y otro que hace <code>loadCSS*</code> y <code>load(tag)</code>. Cada componente se carga solo.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-cdn-snippet id=\"csPlay\" tag=\"iswc-button\"></iswc-cdn-snippet>",
          "target": "#csPlay",
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:tag",
              "label": "tag",
              "options": [
                "iswc-button",
                "iswc-popconfirm",
                "iswc-chart",
                "iswc-textarea"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:category",
              "label": "category"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:title",
              "label": "title"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:base",
              "label": "base (override CDN)"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:dependencies",
              "label": "dependencies (JSON)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dependencies",
      "title": "Dependencias externas",
      "lede": [
        "Si tu componente necesita otra librería para funcionar (p. ej. dayjs para",
        "          fechas), declara sus enlaces con el slot <code class=\"code\">deps</code>:",
        "          un <code class=\"code\">&lt;script type=\"application/json\"&gt;</code> con un array de",
        "          objetos <code class=\"code\">{name, version?, css?, js?, note?}</code>. El componente",
        "          pinta una fila por cada dep con borde y label distintos, para que se note",
        "          que son REQUISITOS, no opciones del componente."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-cdn-snippet",
            "            tag=\"iswc-popconfirm\"",
            "            category=\"feedback\"",
            "            title=\"Popconfirm — Consumo por CDN\"",
            "          >",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\" slot=\"deps\">",
            "              [",
            "                {",
            "                  \"name\": \"dayjs\",",
            "                  \"version\": \"1.11.13\",",
            "                  \"js\":  \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/dayjs@1.11.13/dayjs.min.js\",",
            "                  \"note\": \"Formatea fechas y horas en la UI del componente (API estilo Moment, ~2 kB). Sin CSS propio.\"",
            "                }",
            "              ]",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-cdn-snippet>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "deps-attribute",
      "title": "Dependencias vía atributo",
      "lede": [
        "Si te queda más cómodo, también puedes pasar las deps como atributo",
        "          <code class=\"code\">dependencies</code> con JSON. El slot y el atributo se",
        "          MERGEAN: si pasas ambos, el atributo gana."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-cdn-snippet",
            "            tag=\"iswc-chart\"",
            "            category=\"data\"",
            "            dependencies='[",
            "              {\"name\":\"Chart.js\",\"version\":\"4.4.0\",\"js\":\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js\",\"note\":\"Necesario si usas &lt;iswc-chart&gt; con type=&quot;bar&quot; o &quot;line&quot;.\"}",
            "            ]'",
            "          ></iswc-cdn-snippet>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "multiple",
      "title": "Múltiples dependencias",
      "lede": [
        "Puedes declarar N deps en el mismo array. El componente las pinta",
        "          todas, en el orden dado, con su propio bloque copiable."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-cdn-snippet tag=\"iswc-textarea\" category=\"forms\" title=\"Textarea + dayjs + plugin\">",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\" slot=\"deps\">",
            "              [",
            "                {",
            "                  \"name\": \"dayjs\",",
            "                  \"version\": \"1.11.13\",",
            "                  \"js\":  \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/dayjs@1.11.13/dayjs.min.js\",",
            "                  \"note\": \"Formatea fechas y horas en el campo.\"",
            "                },",
            "                {",
            "                  \"name\": \"dayjs · plugin relativeTime\",",
            "                  \"version\": \"1.11.13\",",
            "                  \"js\":  \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/dayjs@1.11.13/plugin/relativeTime.js\",",
            "                  \"note\": \"Opcional. Muestra horas relativas (p. ej. \\\"hace 2 días\\\").\"",
            "                }",
            "              ]",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-cdn-snippet>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "API",
            "Detalle"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>tag</code>",
              "string — p. ej. <code>\"iswc-button\"</code>. El snippet siempre hace load de ese tag."
            ],
            [
              "<code>base</code>",
              "string — override del CDN base (default <code>cdn.jsdelivr.net/.../dist/cdn</code>)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>title</code>",
              "string — título del panel (default \"Consumo por CDN\")"
            ],
            [
              "<code>dependencies</code>",
              "JSON string — array de deps externas (alternativa al slot)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>slot=\"deps\"</code>",
              "<code>&lt;script type=\"application/json\"&gt;</code> con array de deps"
            ],
            [
              "Dep shape",
              "<code>{name, version?, css?, js?, note?}</code> &mdash; css y js son opcionales independientes"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
